  "text": "Intake note (Commercial team, 3 February 2019). Our client Smita Ahuja is a 75-year-old restaurant owner who lives at Bungalow 3, Naupada, Thane 400624 and can be reached on +91 61742 37860 or smita.ahuja@example.in. The client's PAN YEMPA5551F.\nThe client consulted us about a cheque bounce matter against M/s Goyal Traders. A cheque for INR 8,65,000/- issued by M/s Goyal Traders bounced: the cheque was returned unpaid for insufficient funds.\nThe cheque was deposited in the client's account no. 755144171602 (IFSC ICIC0363865).\nThe matter was filed as CC/2264/2019 before the Judicial Magistrate First Class Court at Thane on 03/07/2019.",
